graph TD
    Query[Current turn<br/>query + context summary] --> Planner[Planning Agent]
    Planner --> CacheCheck{Follow-up vector search cache?}
    CacheCheck -->|cache hit| Spaces[Relevant Genie spaces<br/>space_id + title + score]
    CacheCheck -->|cache miss or new question| VS[Vector Search<br/>Genie space index]
    VS --> CacheStore[Store vector search results<br/>thread TTL cache]
    CacheStore --> Spaces

    Spaces --> Plan[Create execution plan<br/>original query + context summary]
    Plan --> Override{Force route override?}
    Override -->|table_route| Table[Set table route]
    Override -->|genie_route| Genie[Set Genie route]
    Override -->|auto| Strategy{join_strategy from plan}

    Strategy -->|genie_route| Genie
    Strategy -->|otherwise| Table

    Table --> Output[Plan state updates<br/>sub_questions + relevant_space_ids<br/>join_strategy + next_agent]
    Genie --> Output
    Output --> Next{next_agent}
    Next -->|sql_synthesis_table| TableNext[SQL synthesis table route]
    Next -->|sql_synthesis_genie| GenieNext[SQL synthesis Genie route]
    Next -->|summarize| SummaryNext[Summarize]

    classDef agentClass fill:#4A90E2,stroke:#2E5C8A,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    classDef dataClass fill:#50C878,stroke:#2E7D4E,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    classDef processClass fill:#F5A623,stroke:#C17D11,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
    classDef decisionClass fill:#8E44AD,stroke:#6C3483,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff

    class Planner agentClass
    class Query,Spaces,Output dataClass
    class VS,CacheStore,Plan,Table,Genie,TableNext,GenieNext,SummaryNext processClass
    class CacheCheck,Override,Strategy,Next decisionClass
